%% Owner: docs/04-corpus.md — the fixed structure every Form 10-K follows, and where our files deviate.
flowchart TD
    classDef io fill:#ffffff,stroke:#111827,color:#111827
    classDef ingest fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#0b1f4d
    classDef legend fill:#fafafa,stroke:#9ca3af,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#374151

    tenk["Form 10-K"]:::io
    cover["Cover page + table of contents"]:::ingest
    p1["Part I"]:::ingest
    i1["Item 1 Business · Item 1A Risk Factors<br/>Items 1B-4"]:::ingest
    p2["Part II"]:::ingest
    i7["Item 7 MD&A<br/>Management's Discussion and Analysis"]:::ingest
    i7a["Item 7A Market risk"]:::ingest
    i8["Item 8 Financial statements + notes<br/>most of the tables"]:::ingest
    p34["Parts III-IV<br/>Items 10-16: governance, exhibit index"]:::ingest
    sig["Signature page<br/>'Pursuant to the requirements of Section 13…'"]:::ingest
    after["After the signatures<br/>exhibits: contracts, plans, certifications<br/>Corning: also the financial statements"]:::ingest
    legend["Legend<br/>blue = what ingestion must parse"]:::legend

    tenk -->|starts with| cover
    cover -->|then| p1
    p1 -->|contains| i1
    p1 -->|then| p2
    p2 -->|contains| i7
    p2 -->|contains| i7a
    p2 -->|contains| i8
    p2 -->|then| p34
    p34 -->|then| sig
    sig -->|followed by| after
